WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:16.900
The Arctic, as we know it, is disappearing.
This great, white place that was hostile

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.540
to any human being -

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.960
- this place that was a dream for centuries -

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:34.580
-  a place that challenged man to come and conquer it -

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.100
it is disappearing.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:44.700
We don't know what it's future will be, but we know that

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:51.040
the Arctic as I have reference in human life

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:58.320
and therefore in culture is going to be
a memory.

